    "z0": 12206,
    "x1": 23630,
    "z1": 13396
   },
   "text": "OFFICE, painted on the planks. There's candlelight under the door."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 7480,
    "z0": 22440,
    "x1": 10710,
    "z1": 26860
   },
   "text": "A pick and a shovel, dropped. Whoever worked here ran."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 28560,
    "z0": 12920,
    "x1": 31110,
    "z1": 16320
   },
   "text": "Drops of blood along the rails, on toward the workings.\nHal came this way."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 21930,
